'''architectonically''' (är″ki-tek-ton′i-ka̤l-i), ''adv.'' In an architectonic manner; according to true structural principles or fitness.

'''architectonics''' (är″ki-tek-ton′iks), ''n. pl.'' Same as ''architectonic'', ''n.'', 1.

